# SEO Rules

Focus on:

- Solar subsidy + state
- Solar cost + state
- Solar calculator pages
- FAQ pages
- Long-tail solar searches

Content should:

- Be useful.
- Be easy to understand.
- Lead users toward calculators.

Avoid:

- Thin content.
- Keyword stuffing.
- Generic filler.
